Short:    JEOLast v1.22b - ABBS last callers utility
Author:   jolausen@sn.no (Jan Erik Olausen)
Type:     comm/abbs
Replaces: comm/abbs/JEOLast*
                               
>                   JEOLast v1.22b - by Jan Erik Olausen
>>                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  JEOLast generates an ANSI-file over the last specified # of callers.

  Please read the doc-file for more information...

  Changes in this version:
	There was a bug when a user uploaded or downloaded a grab different from a
	QWK-grab. Silly bug now fixed. Changes some code for more exact output.
	The optional bold text when baud rate >= 28800 is changed to > 28800.

>> You are welcome to call PREMIERE BBS for updates.
